sequenceDiagram
    participant App as "Application<br/>startup"
    participant Spring as "Spring Boot<br/>Environment"
    participant Props as "application.yml<br/>spring.mail.*"
    participant AutoCfg as "Spring Boot Mail autoconfig"
    participant Mail as "JavaMailSenderImpl<br/>(bean)"

    App->>Spring: start
    Spring->>Props: read mail properties
    Spring->>AutoCfg: configure JavaMailSender
    AutoCfg->>Mail: JavaMailSenderImpl configured (host,port,user,pass)
    Note right of Mail: available for email sending
